// | >=       | Integer                     | Greater than or equal to<br>Not supported on Date fields               |
// | <=       | Integer                     | Lower than or equal to<br>Not supported on Date fields                 |
// | ~        | String                               | Contains                                                                |
// | !~       | String                               | Doesn't Contain                                                         |
// | ^        | String                               | Starts With                                                             |
// | $        | String                               | Ends With                                                               |
